# Design — personal site

## Palette

- Background: `#FDF8F0` (page), `#F2EFEA` (muted panels).
- Text: `#1F1F1F` primary, `#5B5752` secondary.
- Single accent: `#4F5B7A` (muted indigo)—CTAs, active nav, key links only.
- No neon, no gradients-as-background, no glass blur stacks.

## Typography

- Headings: Cormorant Garamond (self-hosted).
- Body: Inter (self-hosted).
- Code/technical labels: `ui-monospace` stack; reserve a monospace webfont only when necessary.

## Layout

- Max width ~960px for prose; ~1200px for grids.
- Section spacing ≥ 2rem; mobile-first from 375px.

## Motion

- Transitions ≤ 200ms; hover scale on cards ≤ 1.02.
- One subtle fade-in on scroll is acceptable; no autoplay, particles, or cursor trails.
- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`.

## Forbidden (“disco list”)

Parallax hero video, particle/WebGL backgrounds, rotating carousels, typewriter heroes, wavy cursors, emoji-as-icons, autoplay audio/video, heavy glow gradients.
